    "scenesThatPass": [
      "REBECCA: How much for a glazed?\nEILEEN: Oh, no, they’re free.\nREBECCA: Just kidding. I’m Rebecca.\nEILEEN: I know.",
      "EILEEN: Where are you from?\nREBECCA: Oh, I’m from New York originally. Manhattan. I couldn’t stand Cambridge, way too uptight. Well, there were a couple of interesting people. B…\nREBECCA: I just needed a break. Get some fresh air. And I love the beach.\nREBECCA: Alright. 32, 24, 34. Practically my measurements.",
      "REBECCA: Oh, Eileen. Can I help you?\nEILEEN: You left your notebook.\nREBECCA: Oh, thank you so much. I needed this. I hope you didn’t read it.\nEILEEN: Of course not.",
      "EILEEN: Hi.\nREBECCA: Oh, Eileen!\nREBECCA: What will you have?\nEILEEN: I’ll have a beer, I guess.",
      "REBECCA: Oh my stars, you’re absolutely frozen. One beer please and maybe a little whisky to warm up my girl.\nREBECCA: What say, huh?\nREBECCA: Oh, my, you look very glamorous.\nEILEEN: It’s just an old dress."
    ]
  },
